Apache TinkerPop
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains files from Apache TinkerPop (https://tinkerpop.apache.org),
version 3.8.2 (tag 3.8.2, commit 952d8d8e4c3cd37ed8e192ecb97348e6e82594a9), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0, and used unmodified unless stated otherwise, in the
TinkerPop conformance test suite (in the source tree under
crates/graphersal/tests/tinkerpop/, which carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE):

  - features/       the Gremlin Gherkin feature files (each with its Apache-2.0 header), from
                    gremlin-test/src/main/resources/org/apache/tinkerpop/gremlin/test/features/
  - data/           the sample graphs tinkerpop-modern, tinkerpop-crew, tinkerpop-sink and
                    grateful-dead, from data/
  - api-3.8.2.txt   a list of traversal API names derived from
                    gremlin-language/src/main/antlr4/Gremlin.g4 and gremlin-core's __.java

The "modern" sample graph that the library can build in code reproduces the same TinkerPop
sample data.

