openCypher TCK
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains files from the openCypher project
(https://github.com/opencypher/openCypher), release 2024.3 (tag 2024.3, commit
677cbafabb8c3c5eed458fd3b1ec0daec8d67d23), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
and used unmodified, in the openCypher TCK test suite of Graphersal's GQL query language (in
the source tree under crates/graphersal/tests/opencypher/, which carries its own LICENSE and
NOTICE):

  - features/       the Technology Compatibility Kit (TCK) Gherkin feature files (each with
                    its Apache-2.0 header and Attribution Notice), from tck/features/
  - graphs/         the TCK named graphs binary-tree-1 and binary-tree-2 with their metadata,
                    from tck/graphs/

Graphersal's GQL is measured against the openCypher TCK and accepts Cypher compatibility
forms. It is not Cypher and not openCypher, and it is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
sponsored by Neo4j or the openCypher Implementers Group. Cypher® is a registered trademark of
Neo4j Inc.; the names Cypher and openCypher are used here only to describe compatibility
testing.

